Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/arena_view_escape.jet:5:11
    |
  5 | fn make() => Int {
    |           ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`

Error [E0631]: `x` cannot be shared — it does not live long enough to be returned
  --> tests/ui/arena_view_escape.jet:8:12
    |
  8 |     return x
    |            ^
 Why: `x` is a view into `arena`; sharing it outside the region would let it outlive `arena` and point into freed memory
 Fix: keep `x` inside the `arena` region, or copy what you need out with `~` before it leaves
